  \"21-26: intervention phase (ablation ladder -> route=persistent-top-subspace, \"\n        \"mode-redundant; persistence wires H4@sigma2, H0@sigma1; gain probe anomaly resolved).\\n\"\n        \"Artifacts: METRICS.md (definitions + circuit + interventions), out_run*.txt, runlog.txt.\\n\"\n        \"Open (gated on harness, not analysis): lnf/W_E/W_U for vocab side; forward pass for \"\n        \"behavior-level intervention verdicts.\\n\")\n    log(\"appended: METRICS.md addendum + runlog session summary\")\n    log(\"workspace:\", sorted(os.listdir(\".\")))\n    log(\"=== PHASE CLOSED (27/100) ===\")\nrun_sec(\"seal\", sec_seal)\nlog(\"=== exit ===\")\n", "out": "[   0.00s] === start === run27-seal 3.12.13\n[   0.00s] env check: blocks.npz loads, 40 keys\n\n[stderr]\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<string>\", line 43, in <module>\nNameError: name 'run_sec' is not defined\n"}
